      "content": "Substance that gives oxygen or removes hydrogen."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uogu3pl",
      "content": "<strong>Reducing Agent:</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1yq9yki",
      "content": "Substance that gives hydrogen or removes oxygen."
    },
    {
      "id": "984o00x",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Corrosion"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3vdolrh",
      "content": "Corrosion is the slow destruction of metals due to chemical reaction with environment."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "z8kemir",
      "content": "Example: Rusting of iron requires oxygen and moisture."
    },
    {
