    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Identification of oxidising and reducing agents in specified redox equations is a frequently asked question.",
        "Thermal decomposition of lead nitrate yielding brown fumes of nitrogen dioxide (NO2) is a standard high-yield exam reaction.",
        "Questions often test the application of galvanisation (zinc coating) for corrosion prevention and nitrogen flushing to prevent rancidity."
      ],
